%% MUPP-065 Chat field above the keyboard
%% How the open chat card follows the visible part of the screen while the keyboard is up.
flowchart TD
    A[Chat card opens] --> B[Listeners on the visual viewport: resize and scroll, R1]
    B --> C{Visible part more than 100 px shorter than the page?}
    C -- no, no keyboard --> D[No inline size: 75dvh and centred, R2 R3]
    C -- yes, keyboard up --> E[Card top at the viewport top + 8 px, height viewport - 16 px at most 75 percent, R1]
    E --> F[Message list shrinks and scrolls, field and Skicka stay in view]
    F --> C
    D --> C
    A --> G[Card closes]
    G --> H[Listeners and inline size removed, R2]
